id=malachite_backlight_sync_off
name=malachite: brightness fix for 20261016
version=1.1
versionCode=2
author=noamtu123
description=Fixes the brightness slider on LineageOS 23.2 malachite 20261016: keeps the display composer from putting the backlight in MediaTek's sync mode (vendor.debug.hwc.plat_switch_clear_bit=15). Not needed on later builds. Remove the module and reboot to undo.
